td><strong>UT_Test_opgraph</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/3939/slog.tar.gz>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>API_Check</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=159009c0ac554d919654182be403f4cf&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>ATK_Test_A2</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-04-17 16:06:18] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-04-17T15:59:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-17T16:06:18+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168667953,"discussion_id":"f574fe8264169be39a301e9a4bfa49ade201f37b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了在特定边界条件下计算循环尾部数据长度（`ubTail`）的逻辑错误。原代码使用 `gatherSize % ubFactor` 计算，当 `gatherSize` 为 `ubFactor` 的整数倍时，`ubTail` 会错误地计算为0，可能导致后续数据处理逻辑（如内存拷贝）出现异常或数据丢失。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n将 `ubTail` 的计算逻辑从 `gatherSize % ubFactor` 修改为 `gatherSize - ubFactor * (ubLoop - 1)`。新公式直接基于总数据量和完整循环次数进行计算，确保了在任何情况下（包括 `gatherSize` 是 `ubFactor` 整数倍时）都能正确计算出最后一次循环需要处理的数据量，从而保证了数据处理的完整性和正确性。","created_at":"2026-04-17T16:00:05+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-17T16:00:05+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168668301,"discussion_id":"64e799a5b9732942a52bd8bb23654f18d043c323","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=669b4d37f09c4c088c393fdbf0f50b93&pipelineRunId=d8fdee4603574b1ab64a5df3725c5414&projectName=CANN'>d8fdee4603574b1ab64a5df3725c5414</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_cc09eb36f209470ca2741d8ac23121a8/200441e360137afb3c3ebace6bb66fec?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>anti_virus</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckNew/poisoningresult/c6718c42-43c3-4612-b6e7-d7c6e789231f/CANN/ops-nn?projectName=CANN&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>